            "review_text": "Alayna H\n6 contributions\n0\nLOVE LOVE\nJul 2022 • Family\nTHE BEST FOOD EVER. I am vegetarian and they had SO many delicious options that I could indulge in! My family eats meat, and they said their food was excellent too! You really can’t go wrong with anything you order. What stuck out to me the most was the delicious garlic naan, which goes with any meal, and the chana masala, my favorite vegetarian option. I am really going to miss this restaurant.\nRead more\nWritten July 25, 2022",
