            "review_title": "Review at Family Indian Restaurant 2",
            "review_text": "nrm77\nLondon, United Kingdom1020 contributions\n0\nExcellent Indian food\nJul 2019\nAfter a few days in Danang, we had grown homesick and wanted some Indian food. We then asked the hotel concierge and it was located quite close to My Khe beach. The restaurant had excellent Palak Paneer and garlic naan. And I really mean it was excellent, because I am very critical of Indian food outside India otherwise. We really enjoyed the meals here and highly recommend it for Indian food in Danang.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 11, 2020",
