            "review_text": "LFoodieBrighton\nBrighton, United Kingdom94 contributions\n0\nDoesn't taste like Indian food\nAug 2017 • Friends\nAfter reading so many great reviews we couldn't wait to come here. We started with the tandoori chicken which was very overcooked and dry, and the chilli chicken which was our favourite meal of the evening. For main we had the chicken tikka masala which had a very smoked flavour, not to my liking. The Goan fish curry was more like a fish soup and the fish was quite tough. The biggest surprise was the chicken tikka jalfrezi. It tasted more like chicken fajitas. It wasn't bad, but did not resemble any Indian food. For almost 600,000 the meal was disappointing.\nRead more\nWritten August 15, 2017",
